      "reproduction": "Real CLI menu capture: normal movement20,-10 then neutral0,0 renders0,0 while reporting is disabled. Raw PS2 equivalent bypasses reporting and renders60,30 because partial packets move the cursor. Both render20,10 after corrections. Existing graphic.c correction retains vm_unmap_phys for mapped framebuffers, verified by the original Close-menu reproduction."
